WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:04.540
Coming in to Samuel L. Jackson as Shaft, it was no different.

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:09.360
I wanted to really embrace him as Shaft two thousand.

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:15.510
And come up with ideas that would give that same kind of power to Sam

00:00:15.690 --> 00:00:19.320
in the character and fashion. It was also a fashion statement.

00:00:19.410 --> 00:00:22.440
Well, because those letters are much more subtle than the hard leather

00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:23.760
that Richard Roundtree wore.

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:25.500
Weren't they? The ones you put Sam in.

00:00:26.310 --> 00:00:28.320
Yeah. With Shaft two thousand.

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:31.350
I'm just trying to, you know, I'm paying attention, that's all.

00:00:31.350 --> 00:00:31.960
You are!

00:00:32.310 --> 00:00:34.760
I'm just a trained journalist seeking fullness of detail.

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:36.500
That's all I'm doing here for you Ruth.

00:00:36.540 --> 00:00:40.430
But you dress characters and we can see the swagger in them.

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:42.450
You want us to get a sense of how these people,

00:00:43.190 --> 00:00:45.090
these characters plant their feet on the ground.

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:49.860
And it's funny to say that, but I get a sense of even.

00:00:49.860 --> 00:00:53.760
Seeing somebody from the shoulders up when you costume them what shoes they're wearing.

00:00:53.760 --> 00:00:56.310
I can tell from the way they're standing, you know,

00:00:56.610 --> 00:00:59.250
There's a kind of a pride that goes all the way down, isn't there?

00:00:59.620 --> 00:01:04.500
Yeah, there is. I think of Eddie in Dolemite.

00:01:04.530 --> 00:01:10.050
He had to wear a lot of platform shoes and, you know, guys aren't wearing those anymore.

00:01:10.050 --> 00:01:15.210
So, you know, just the whole idea of it was I'm sure we laughed about it,

00:01:15.210 --> 00:01:17.490
But poor Eddie had to wear them.

00:01:17.760 --> 00:01:21.930
And after a while we had to decide what shots were not.

00:01:21.930 --> 00:01:24.810
seeing his feet so he could put his tennis shoes back on.

00:01:25.380 --> 00:01:32.220
But he does say that the costume design does help him give a get a sense of his posture.

00:01:32.430 --> 00:01:37.500
And his his gait, and it does support his performance.

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:43.050
And to hear someone iconic like Eddie Murphy say that, it's wonderful.

